          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The last word you looked up that year was alone."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "文曲星",
          "t": "alone  adj. by oneself; lonely. adv. on one's own."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "同桌",
          "t": "What's there to look up? Everyone knows that one."
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "I knew it. I looked it up to see if it had any other meaning."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Today is over."
        }
      ]
    },
    "box": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "In the little box, an electronic dictionary. Clamshell, silver-grey, the hinge a little loose."
